                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is The Bear House's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Heritage-inspired + vintage-styled niche positioning + quality-first product. Distinctive space in Indian menswear.</p>
                                        <h3>Can smaller niche fashion brands succeed?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — niche positioning + product quality + editorial storytelling + patient scaling. Not everyone needs to be mass leader.</p>
                                        <h3>The Bear House vs Rare Rabbit vs Snitch?</h3>
                                        <p>All three menswear D2C but different positioning. Rare Rabbit premium professional; Snitch fashion-forward younger; The Bear House heritage + vintage-styled. Coexist by segment differentiation.</p>
                                        <h3>Should niche fashion do Amazon / Myntra?</h3>
                                        <p>Selective yes for volume. Reserve premium + heritage collections for brand.com to protect margin + storytelling.</p>
